   "core/parsers/anf_commitment.py - Abercrombie & Fitch Commitment sheet (structural).\n\nOne file = one Commitment. The PO PDFs reference a ``Commitment:`` number but do\nNOT carry the Key Item (KI) / Mill / Fabric - this sheet supplies them. The ANF\nfolder flow parses every Commitment PDF into a ``CommitmentStore`` record keyed by\n``Commitment #``; later POs look the number up to backfill KI / mill / fabric.\n\nSource fields observed (one per file):\n    Commitment # 1190449\n    Key Item 26051\n    Tech Pack # 339260253\n    Mill Name Abercrombie & Fitch ... / Wuxi Goldsmile ...\n    Fabric Ref Code KNT000194\n    Vendor 401052   Factory 15126\n    Ship Via ...   Ship Date 08/28/26   Carton Standard 6\n",
